      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It would be great if udon exposed terrains GetSplatMaterialPropertyBlock as well, since it's necessary to make runtime baked lightmap changes to the terrain.\n\nExposing this method would allow us to bake seperate lightmaps and have a working day/night cycle with awesome visual fidelity and performance for terrains. \n\nAs of right now, it's only possible to change baked lighting of Mesh Renderers.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
