      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "67fd05053b91a0961bcff9a1",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Currently `UnityEngine.Terrain` seems to have been overlooked when choosing which classes to or not to expose to UDON. Not only is it not exposed. it's not even listed in the class exposure tree as an unexposed class. This seems to suggest an oversight to me rather than an intentional omission.\n\nWith `UnityEngine.Terrain` exposed, developers could alter their terrain and its textures for more dynamic behaviors.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Expose UnityEngine.Terrain to UDON",
